    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "'Menagerie Manor’,  Hedge Road, Garristown, Co. Meath. \r\nDormer Bungalow Residence on c. 14 Acres/5.66 Hectares.\r\n\r\n\r\nRare opportunity to acquire a wonderful equestrian property set amidst C.14 aces of excellent quality land which command extensive frontage to the county road, The stables, foaling box, large secure store and sand menage, are to the rear of the property and offer easy access to the paddocks.\r\n\r\nThe residence and yard nestles into a wonderful pastoral setting offering a complete sense of peace and tranquillity. \r\n\r\nWithin close proximity of the M1/N2/M2.  It is 25-minute drive to Dublin Airport and M50, 15-minute drive to Ashbourne Town and five-minute drive to Garristown. There are a host of other amenities that include a variety of supermarkets, shops, schools, parks and sporting facilities.   Other local recreational amenities of Golf Clubs, GAA Clubs, Rugby clubs, the Fairyhouse Racecourse,  and Emerald Park are only a short drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception Hall                                                   5.80m x 2.60m\r\nStairs to 1st floor, under stairs storage.                                                \r\n\r\nReception Room                                                5.00m x 3.90m                                      \r\nWood burning stove, carpeted floor, door to hall and\r\nkitchen, patio door to garden with enclosed covered \r\nterrace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/living room                                           9.40m x 3.95m                       \r\nWall & floor units, hob, dishwasher, larder unit.\r\nTiled floor to kitchen, carpet to living area.\r\nWood burning stove.\r\n\r\nLarge Utility Room                                            3.90m x 2.92m\r\nWall & floor units, tiled floor, ss sink, oven.\r\ndoor to rear garden.\r\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \r\nMain Bedroom 1                                                5.00m x 4.10m                                        \r\nSpacious bright room with en-suite.\r\nWalk-in wardrobe.                                              2.80m x 1.50m\r\n\r\nWet Room                                                           2.80m x 2.70m                                                        \r\nShower, WC, WHB, Tiled Floor\r\n\r\nLanding:                                                              4.21m x 2.85m\r\nVelux window.\r\n\r\nLarge Hot press\r\nCloakroom.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2                                                           3.87m x 3.31m                                                    \r\nWalk-in wardrobe.                                                1.85m x 1.77m\r\n\r\nLobby area                                                          4.00m x 1.40m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3                                                           3.90m x 3.31m                                                      \r\nEves storage.                                                         \r\n\r\nBathroom                                                           \r\nBath, Shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor & walls.\r\nHeated towel rail, Velux window. \r\n\r\nLand:                                                                                                 \r\nLand c. 14 Acres, excellent quality with  extensive frontage to the county road .\r\nEasy access to the paddocks.\r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nStable block- includes 3 standard stables and 1 foaling box.\r\nLarge secure store.\r\n40m x 20m Sand Menage\r\nGravel Entrance.\r\nLawn front, side and rear.\r\nWell stocked with decorative trees and shrubs. \r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\n\r\n•\tE.S.B. (Smart Meter)\r\n•\tWater group scheme – mains,  septic tank, alarm, & security lights."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent location \r\nPresented in good condition.\r\n15-minute drive to Ashbourne Town\r\n25-minute drive to Dublin Airport\r\n2 Reception rooms\r\n2 bathrooms \r\nC. 14 Acres/5.66 Hectares Prime Pasture\r\nExtensive road frontage offering the possibility\r\nTo construct further dwellings \r\n(subject to Planning permission)"
      },
